<title>BELGIUM: EU Commision economic forecast for Greece.</title>
<headline>EU Commision economic forecast for Greece.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Greece -</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 2.4	  2.5</p>
<p> Investment			 7.3	  7.4</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     8.5	  6.9</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     9.1	  9.0</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  7.9	  6.5</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 110.6	109.3</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6830</p>
</text>
